  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-China Cooperation on Environment and Green Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will aim to improve the level playing field between the EU and China on environmental requirements for circular economy, chemicals, deforestation, biodiversity, pollution, water management, etc. This will be done through reinforced EU-China policy dialogues and cooperation in environment and green economy to align China&apos;s environmental legislation framework with that of the EU.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
